Z||000020||Raydar||12-17-2001||12:23 PM||||True computer support story:<P>All of our systems are NT based.<BR>We had a customer call the help desk.<P>Customer: "I can't log on to my computer."<BR>Help Desk: "What seems to be the problem?"<BR>Customer: "Somebody else's name is on the top line."<P>This particular customer's nickname is Cheerio. <BR>(What did the blonde say when she saw a bowl of Cheerios?  Oh look! Donut seeds!)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
